### Login to get a token
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "day9demo@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Get all tickets so we can grab a real id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

###

### Update a ticket - expect 200 with the updated fields echoed back
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/6a633fd73d181d1ac0533aca
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Printer jam",
  "description": "Paper stuck in tray 2",
  "category": "Hardware",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}
